{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lighthearted resource-management game of running an indie game studio! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience 12 intense months in-game, and a spectacular masterpiece will launch! You are that producer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Manage and grow your own indie game studio as a rookie entrepreneur out to prove your worth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Unlock and expand your empire: from a cramped studio to meeting rooms, game expos, and publisher deals!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Tackle crises that threaten your project during both development and publishing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Recruit a team of partners \u2014 there's strength in numbers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Experience five distinct endings!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014Will you end up a meme among players, or a legend in the gaming world?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705980?t=1757376934","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705980/6b64bbc542d58894ac55b6d02a36088c54d7d27b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757376934","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705980/790997c32a87f387d5b1267b00ed8a0c5ab67866/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757376934","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705980/790997c32a87f387d5b1267b00ed8a0c5ab67866/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757376934","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"i